{"files":{"umbuchen":{"sig":"caec4b6cd0","file":"umbuchen-caec4b6cd0.mp3"},"hotelproblem":{"sig":"1570666cb9","file":"hotelproblem-1570666cb9.mp3"},"essengehen":{"sig":"84bdfe224e","file":"essengehen-84bdfe224e.mp3"},"tagestour":{"sig":"bdb91fa466","file":"tagestour-bdb91fa466.mp3"},"arzt":{"sig":"bc709b6e53","file":"arzt-bc709b6e53.mp3"},"zugausfall":{"sig":"de4eb80556","file":"zugausfall-de4eb80556.mp3"},"umtausch":{"sig":"6f2ff6ff4e","file":"umtausch-6f2ff6ff4e.mp3"},"reisebekannte":{"sig":"e4bea29c24","file":"reisebekannte-e4bea29c24.mp3"}},"clips":{"I've missed my connecting flight.":["umbuchen",0.3,1.963,2.613,2.816],"My first flight was delayed.":["umbuchen",5.779,1.813,7.942,2.624],"Could you put me on the next flight?":["umbuchen",10.916,1.856,13.122,2.709],"Is there an earlier option?":["umbuchen",16.181,1.707,18.238,2.453],"Will my luggage be transferred automatically?":["umbuchen",21.041,2.624,24.015,3.712],"Am I entitled to a meal voucher?":["umbuchen",28.077,2.219,30.646,3.029],"Could you write that down for me?":["umbuchen",34.025,1.707,36.082,2.56],"I'd rather not wait until tomorrow.":["umbuchen",38.992,2.176,41.518,3.051],"Good afternoon. How can I help you?":["umbuchen",44.919,2.176,47.445,3.051],"Hello. I've missed my connecting flight to Edinburgh. My flight from Frankfurt was delayed.":["umbuchen",50.845,5.013,56.209,7.019],"I'm sorry about that. Let me have a look. The next available flight leaves at eight fifteen this evening.":["umbuchen",63.577,5.717,69.645,8.256],"That's quite late. Is there an earlier option, perhaps with another airline?":["umbuchen",78.251,4.096,82.697,5.675],"There's a flight at five, but it's fully booked. I can put you on the waiting list, if you like.":["umbuchen",88.721,4.757,93.829,6.763],"Yes, please. And will my luggage be transferred automatically?":["umbuchen",100.941,3.392,104.683,4.779],"Yes, it will go on the same flight as you. Here's a voucher for a meal while you wait.":["umbuchen",109.812,4.501,114.663,6.464],"That's very kind. Could you write down the flight number for me?":["umbuchen",121.477,3.371,125.198,4.757],"Of course. It's BA 1447, departing from gate thirty-two.":["umbuchen",130.305,5.461,136.117,7.701],"The flight is fully booked, I'm afraid.":["umbuchen",144.168,2.475,146.993,3.413],"Could you put me on the waiting list, please?":["umbuchen",150.756,2.155],"Would you like a meal voucher?":["umbuchen",153.261,1.877,155.488,2.645],"Yes, please. That's very kind of you.":["umbuchen",158.483,2.027],"Is there anything else I can do for you?":["umbuchen",160.86,2.389,163.599,3.264],"No, thank you. You've been very helpful.":["umbuchen",167.213,2.155],"I'm afraid there's a problem with my room.":["hotelproblem",0.3,2.304,2.954,3.285],"The heating doesn't seem to be working.":["hotelproblem",6.589,2.133,9.073,2.965],"I asked for a quiet room.":["hotelproblem",12.388,1.792,14.53,2.475],"Would it be possible to move to another room?":["hotelproblem",17.355,2.219,19.923,3.221],"I'd appreciate it if you could look into it.":["hotelproblem",23.495,2.304,26.149,3.285],"Is breakfast included in the price?":["hotelproblem",29.784,2.091,32.225,3.008],"Could I have a late check-out?":["hotelproblem",35.583,1.856,37.789,2.624],"Could you call a taxi for me tomorrow morning?":["hotelproblem",40.763,2.325,43.438,3.371],"Good evening, madam. Is everything all right with your room?":["hotelproblem",47.159,3.819,51.327,5.355],"Actually, I'm afraid there's a problem. The heating doesn't seem to be working, and it's rather cold.":["hotelproblem",57.032,5.227,62.609,7.317],"Oh dear, I'm very sorry. I'll send someone up straight away.":["hotelproblem",70.276,4.011,74.637,5.568],"Thank you. Also, I asked for a quiet room, but my window faces the main road.":["hotelproblem",80.555,4.459,85.363,6.101],"I see. Would you like to move? We have a room at the back, overlooking the garden.":["hotelproblem",91.815,4.736,96.901,6.72],"That would be lovely. Would it be possible to move this evening?":["hotelproblem",103.971,3.221,107.542,4.629],"Of course. And as an apology, breakfast tomorrow is on us.":["hotelproblem",112.521,4.075,116.946,5.568],"That's very generous of you. Thank you so much.":["hotelproblem",122.864,2.624,125.838,3.712],"Is everything all right with your room?":["hotelproblem",129.9,2.624,132.874,3.691],"I'm afraid there's a problem with the heating.":["hotelproblem",136.915,2.24],"Would you like to move to another room?":["hotelproblem",139.505,2.453,142.308,3.499],"Yes, that would be lovely.":["hotelproblem",146.157,1.536],"What time would you like the taxi?":["hotelproblem",148.043,2.325,150.718,3.285],"At half past seven, please.":["hotelproblem",154.353,1.813],"Could we have a table by the window?":["essengehen",0.3,1.899,2.549,2.773],"What would you recommend?":["essengehen",5.672,1.451,7.473,2.112],"Does this dish contain nuts?":["essengehen",9.935,1.792,12.077,2.624],"My friend is allergic to nuts.":["essengehen",15.051,1.984,17.385,2.88],"Could I have the sauce on the side?":["essengehen",20.615,1.963,22.927,2.731],"I'll have the same, please.":["essengehen",26.008,1.6,27.958,2.325],"Could we have the bill, please?":["essengehen",30.633,1.685,32.669,2.432],"Is service included?":["essengehen",35.451,1.493,37.294,2.176],"Good evening, ladies. Are you ready to order?":["essengehen",39.82,2.923,43.093,4.16],"Almost. What would you recommend today?":["essengehen",47.603,2.069,50.022,2.859],"The lamb is excellent, and we also have fresh sea bass from the coast.":["essengehen",53.231,4.48,58.061,6.208],"The sea bass sounds lovely. Does it contain any nuts? My friend is allergic.":["essengehen",64.619,4.501,69.47,6.528],"The sauce has almonds in it, but we can serve it without the sauce.":["essengehen",76.348,4.117,80.815,5.547],"Perfect. Then two sea bass, one without the sauce, and a bottle of white wine.":["essengehen",86.712,3.968,91.03,5.504],"Very good. Would you like any starters?":["essengehen",96.884,2.603,99.837,3.648],"No, thank you. We'll save some room for dessert.":["essengehen",103.835,2.688,106.873,3.904],"What would you recommend today?":["essengehen",111.127,1.643],"Are you ready to order?":["essengehen",113.119,1.643,115.112,2.261],"Almost. What would you recommend?":["essengehen",117.723,1.835],"How was everything?":["essengehen",119.908,1.429,121.687,2.048],"Delicious, thank you. Compliments to the chef!":["essengehen",124.085,2.517],"Would you like to see the dessert menu?":["essengehen",126.953,2.603,129.905,3.669],"Yes, please. We saved some room!":["essengehen",133.925,1.899],"I'm interested in the day trip to the Lake District.":["tagestour",0.3,2.709,3.359,3.797],"What does the price include?":["tagestour",7.507,1.728,9.585,2.389],"How much walking is involved?":["tagestour",12.324,1.856,14.53,2.645],"Is lunch included?":["tagestour",17.525,1.408,19.283,2.069],"What time do we get back?":["tagestour",21.703,1.6,23.653,2.155],"Is there a discount for pensioners?":["tagestour",26.157,2.027,28.534,2.88],"Where exactly is the pick-up point?":["tagestour",31.764,2.133,34.247,3.029],"What happens if it rains?":["tagestour",37.627,1.707,39.683,2.432],"Hello! Can I help you?":["tagestour",42.465,1.685,44.501,2.347],"Yes, I'm interested in the day trip to the Lake District on Thursday. What does the price include?":["tagestour",47.197,5.333,52.881,7.509],"The coach, a guided boat trip on Lake Windermere and afternoon tea. Lunch isn't included, but there's plenty of time to eat in Ambleside.":["tagestour",60.74,8.32,69.41,11.563],"How much walking is involved? I'm not very good on steep paths.":["tagestour",81.323,3.669,85.342,4.885],"Hardly any. There's an optional walk, but you can stay in the village instead.":["tagestour",90.577,4.224,95.151,6.08],"That sounds ideal. Is there a discount for pensioners?":["tagestour",101.581,3.179,105.11,4.437],"Yes, it's fifty-five pounds instead of sixty-five. The coach leaves from the station at eight and gets back at around six.":["tagestour",109.897,6.827,117.074,9.536],"And what happens if it rains?":["tagestour",126.96,1.856,129.166,2.667],"The trip goes ahead anyway. It's the Lake District – it usually rains!":["tagestour",132.183,4.096,136.629,5.803],"The trip goes ahead anyway.":["tagestour",142.781,1.813],"Would you like to book the trip?":["tagestour",144.945,1.771,147.065,2.517],"Yes, please. One ticket for Thursday.":["tagestour",149.933,2.155],"Do you have any other questions?":["tagestour",152.437,1.877,154.665,2.709],"Yes – where exactly is the pick-up point?":["tagestour",157.724,2.389],"The coach leaves at eight o'clock sharp.":["tagestour",160.463,2.283,163.096,3.243],"Fine, I'll be there at a quarter to eight.":["tagestour",166.689,2.304],"I'd like to make an appointment, please.":["arzt",0.3,2.048,2.698,2.944],"I've had a sore throat since Monday.":["arzt",5.992,2.005,8.347,2.837],"I feel dizzy when I stand up.":["arzt",11.535,1.877,13.762,2.752],"I take tablets for my blood pressure.":["arzt",16.864,2.197,19.411,3.115],"Is it anything serious?":["arzt",22.876,1.621,24.847,2.432],"How often should I take them?":["arzt",27.629,1.749,29.729,2.56],"Do I need a prescription?":["arzt",32.639,1.621,34.61,2.261],"Could I have a receipt for my insurance?":["arzt",37.221,2.24,39.811,3.093],"Good morning. What seems to be the problem?":["arzt",43.255,2.688,46.293,3.733],"I've had a sore throat since Monday, and now I've got a temperature as well.":["arzt",50.376,3.968,54.694,5.589],"Let me have a look. Yes, your throat is quite red. Are you taking any other medication?":["arzt",60.633,5.675,66.658,8.0],"Yes, I take tablets for my blood pressure every morning.":["arzt",75.008,3.072,78.43,4.331],"That's fine. It's a throat infection – nothing serious. I'll give you a prescription for some antibiotics.":["arzt",83.111,6.827,90.287,9.365],"Three times a day, after meals, for five days. And drink plenty of fluids.":["arzt",100.003,5.163,105.515,7.168],"Thank you, doctor. Could I have a receipt for my insurance?":["arzt",113.033,3.392,116.775,4.693],"Of course. The receptionist will give you one on your way out.":["arzt",121.819,4.117,126.286,5.76],"What seems to be the problem?":["arzt",132.396,1.963,134.709,2.709],"Are you taking any other medication?":["arzt",137.768,2.624,140.742,3.691],"Yes, tablets for my blood pressure.":["arzt",144.783,2.069],"Take these three times a day.":["arzt",147.202,2.197,149.749,3.115],"Should I take them before or after meals?":["arzt",153.214,2.432],"The train has been cancelled.":["zugausfall",0.3,1.771,2.421,2.496],"How else can I get to York?":["zugausfall",5.267,1.771,7.387,2.56],"Is my ticket still valid?":["zugausfall",10.297,1.813,12.461,2.581],"Do I have to change trains?":["zugausfall",15.392,1.749,17.491,2.56],"Which platform does it leave from?":["zugausfall",20.401,1.877,22.629,2.645],"Is there a replacement bus service?":["zugausfall",25.624,1.984,27.958,2.944],"Can I get a refund?":["zugausfall",31.252,1.472,33.074,2.112],"Excuse me, is this seat taken?":["zugausfall",35.536,2.005,37.891,2.859],"Excuse me, the board says the ten fifteen to York has been cancelled. How else can I get there?":["zugausfall",41.1,5.312,46.762,7.509],"I'm sorry, there's a problem with the signals. You can take the ten forty to Leeds and change there.":["zugausfall",54.621,5.312,60.283,7.531],"Is my ticket still valid on that train?":["zugausfall",68.164,2.304,70.818,3.264],"Yes, all tickets are valid today on any route to York.":["zugausfall",74.432,3.136,77.918,4.501],"Good. Which platform does it leave from?":["zugausfall",82.769,1.963,85.082,2.944],"Platform seven. You'll have about ten minutes in Leeds to catch your connection.":["zugausfall",88.376,4.267,92.993,5.973],"And what if I miss it?":["zugausfall",99.316,1.579,101.245,2.197],"There's a train every half hour. And because of the delay, you can claim a partial refund online.":["zugausfall",103.792,5.248,109.39,7.467],"Tickets, please!":["zugausfall",117.207,1.387,118.943,1.984],"Here you are. Is this the right train for York?":["zugausfall",121.277,2.539],"Is this seat taken?":["zugausfall",124.166,1.6,126.116,2.283],"No, please go ahead.":["zugausfall",128.749,1.579],"You'll need to change in Leeds.":["zugausfall",130.677,1.941,132.969,2.709],"How long do I have to catch my connection?":["zugausfall",136.028,2.411],"I bought this jumper here yesterday.":["umtausch",0.3,2.133,2.783,3.072],"It's a bit too tight.":["umtausch",6.205,1.429,7.985,2.133],"Could I exchange it for a larger size?":["umtausch",10.468,2.347,13.165,3.349],"I've still got the receipt.":["umtausch",16.864,1.664,18.878,2.389],"There's a small hole in the sleeve.":["umtausch",21.617,1.877,23.845,2.709],"I'd prefer a refund, if that's possible.":["umtausch",26.904,2.347,29.601,3.371],"Could you check if you have it in another colour?":["umtausch",33.321,2.24,35.911,3.243],"I'll take the blue one instead.":["umtausch",39.504,1.856,41.71,2.581],"Hello. I bought this jumper here yesterday, but unfortunately it's a bit too tight.":["umtausch",44.641,4.544,49.535,6.187],"Oh, I'm sorry. Have you got the receipt?":["umtausch",56.072,2.368,58.79,3.243],"Yes, here it is. Could I exchange it for a larger size?":["umtausch",62.383,3.605,66.338,5.099],"Let me check. I'm afraid we haven't got a large in grey. We've only got it in blue or dark green.":["umtausch",71.787,5.44,77.577,7.552],"Hmm. Could I see the blue one?":["umtausch",85.479,1.792,87.621,2.453],"Here you are. The colour really suits you, actually.":["umtausch",90.424,2.795,93.569,3.883],"Do you think so? All right, I'll take the blue one instead.":["umtausch",97.801,2.901,101.053,4.032],"Lovely. There's no extra charge – it's the same price.":["umtausch",105.435,3.179,108.963,4.459],"The colour really suits you.":["umtausch",113.772,1.6],"Have you got the receipt?":["umtausch",115.722,1.643,117.715,2.261],"Yes, here it is.":["umtausch",120.326,1.301],"Would you like a refund or an exchange?":["umtausch",121.977,2.475,124.802,3.456],"An exchange, please – one size larger.":["umtausch",128.608,2.453],"That colour really suits you!":["umtausch",131.411,1.877,133.639,2.645],"Do you think so? Thank you!":["umtausch",136.634,1.579],"Have you been here before?":["reisebekannte",0.3,1.536,2.186,2.24],"It's my first time in Cornwall.":["reisebekannte",4.776,1.984,7.11,2.773],"I've been to London twice.":["reisebekannte",10.233,1.749,12.333,2.581],"I used to work in an office.":["reisebekannte",15.264,1.749,17.363,2.453],"I've been learning English for a few months.":["reisebekannte",20.167,2.069,22.586,2.923],"How long are you staying this time?":["reisebekannte",25.859,1.941,28.15,2.709],"It's been lovely talking to you.":["reisebekannte",31.209,1.813,33.373,2.624],"Enjoy the rest of your stay!":["reisebekannte",36.347,1.728,38.425,2.517],"Lovely view, isn't it? Have you been here before?":["reisebekannte",41.292,3.285,44.927,4.48],"No, it's my first time in Cornwall. But I've been to London twice.":["reisebekannte",49.757,3.904,54.011,5.333],"Your English is very good. Where are you from?":["reisebekannte",59.695,3.072,63.117,4.224],"Thank you! I'm from Germany. I've been learning English again for a few months.":["reisebekannte",67.691,4.224,72.265,5.973],"Well, it shows. My wife and I come here every year. We used to come with our children, but now they're grown up.":["reisebekannte",78.588,7.168,86.106,9.813],"How lovely. How long are you staying this time?":["reisebekannte",96.269,2.475,99.094,3.371],"Two weeks. Have you tried the cream tea in the village yet? It's the best in Cornwall.":["reisebekannte",102.815,5.269,108.434,7.317],"Not yet, but I will! It's been lovely talking to you.":["reisebekannte",116.101,2.923,119.374,4.181],"Likewise. Enjoy the rest of your stay!":["reisebekannte",123.905,2.709,126.965,3.797],"We used to come with our children.":["reisebekannte",131.112,1.792],"No, this is my first time.":["reisebekannte",133.254,1.856],"Likewise! Enjoy the rest of your stay.":["reisebekannte",135.46,2.261],"Have you tried the cream tea yet?":["reisebekannte",138.071,2.304,140.725,3.136],"Not yet, but I'd love to.":["reisebekannte",144.211,1.685]}}